Orochi has been too lenient on you.

175
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:40,720
I'll show you true suffering.

176
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,640
This country will be my weapons factory.

177
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:45,100
And all men.

178
00:19:45,460 --> 00:19:48,660
Women and children will be my slaves.

179
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:54,040
When you're too exhausted
to work, roll over and die.

180
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:57,901
Every time we lose a slave,
we'll just replace it.

181
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:04,340
My wrath is the price you
pay for your defiance.

182
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:08,380
This is what happens
when you lose a battle.

183
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:10,600
Your life belongs to the victor.

184
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:14,509
Your hopes and dreams are mine
to trample, However I please.

185
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:19,140
Bring Momonosuke here.

186
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:22,260
I'll continue to slaughter
until that happens.

187
00:20:24,940 --> 00:20:27,120
Your country is finished.

188
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:31,880
Your children and your children's
children will sink into despair.

189
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:35,000
