194
00:20:45,020 --> 00:20:47,255
Let's butcher them while they're down.

195
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:52,791
It doesn't matter if you took out Big Mom.

196
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:55,317
You are never going to be Commander Daddy.

197
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,812
You took your own dream.

198
00:20:56,980 --> 00:20:58,156
I hope you're happy.

199
00:21:00,540 --> 00:21:01,660
Little shits.

200
