left in you, Trafalgar?

208
00:21:46,540 --> 00:21:50,060
Because I'm not going to
sit here and wait to die.

209
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:54,260
Damn it, Straw Hats.

210
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:00,020
