218
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:17,540
But so is Kaido!

219
00:22:17,740 --> 00:22:19,211
This might be our chance!

220
00:22:19,860 --> 00:22:21,260
Yamato, this is absurd!

221
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:23,700
Kaido is an emperor of the sea!

222
00:22:26,020 --> 00:22:27,844
We underestimated his strength!

223
00:22:27,980 --> 00:22:29,333
It's as simple as that!

224
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:32,155
Victory is no longer within our reach.

225
00:22:32,340 --> 00:22:35,857
If we continue to resist, it
will only result in more deaths.

226
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:38,840
We did our best, but it
simply wasn't enough.

227
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:42,660
I know this is difficult to
hear, but Luffy has lost.

228
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:45,019
We have no choice but to surrender.

229
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:49,360
No, I will never allow that!

230
00:22:49,980 --> 00:22:51,760
